WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.542
Open Knowledge Base in the editor sidebar

00:00:04.542 --> 00:00:12.047
Click Select Knowledge Base and tick one or more

00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:16.290
Add Knowledge Base opens the page to create one

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.511
Attached knowledge bases are listed under the button

00:00:19.511 --> 00:00:21.968
Detach one with its bin icon

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:30.863
Mention it in the prompt: type @ and pick it

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:35.154
Click Save

00:00:35.154 --> 00:00:39.602
The agent now answers policy questions from it
